                                                                        .getAccessibleName()))
                                .doClick();
                    });
            boolean[] plotted = {false};
            for (int i = 0; i < 150 && !plotted[0]; i++) {
                SwingUtilities.invokeAndWait(
                        () ->
                                plotted[0] =
                                        "Hit distribution"
                                                .equals(
                                                        find(panel[0], PlotPanel.class, c -> true)
                                                                .getAccessibleContext()
                                                                .getAccessibleName()));
                if (!plotted[0]) Thread.sleep(20);
